Ronaldo Luiz Corrêa dos Santos. Tópicos sobre a Reciclagem de Metais e Sustentabilidade, CETEM, Série Estudos e Documentos 83, 2014. [Official series catalogue](https://www.cetem.gov.br/antigo/series/serie-estudos-e-documentos?start=20) · [Authorized full monograph](https://www.cetem.gov.br/antigo/series/serie-estudos-e-documentos/item/download/1686_3464fcf2064d97c96300a65aca8d4ef7).

Read the full Portuguese monograph alongside the UNEP report and actual metal-process cases. Compare recovery boundaries, material quality, technical limits, external inputs, and the institutions/work sustaining a recycling chain. Historical examples do not establish current rates or universal performance.

Official title, author, year, series number, and download route were verified on 29 October 2026. Preserve actual CETEM/component rights; free institutional access is distinct from an unrestricted adaptation licence. No monograph PDF, diagrams, or external material-flow data is copied here.

